{"version":1,"slug":"Others__General_Awareness_-_General_Studies_-_Super_Practice_-_SSC_SUPER_PRACTICE_41082_(20Q)","path":"Others/General Awareness - General Studies - Super Practice - SSC SUPER PRACTICE 41082 (20Q).html","title":"devgagan","provider":"Others","category":"General Awareness - General Studies - Super Practice - SSC SUPER PRACTICE 41082 (20Q).html","durationMinutes":60,"totalQuestions":20,"sectionsLocked":false,"sections":null,"questions":[{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is cybersecurity?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2360;&#2366;&#2311;&#2348;&#2352; &#2360;&#2369;&#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Protection of internet-connected systems from cyber threats</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2366;&#2311;&#2348;&#2352; &#2326;&#2340;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2311;&#2306;&#2335;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375;&#2335; &#2360;&#2375; &#2332;&#2369;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2339;&#2366;&#2354;&#2367;&#2351;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2369;&#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">A type of computer virus</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2319;&#2325; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2350;&#2381;&#2346;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2335;&#2352; &#2357;&#2366;&#2351;&#2352;&#2360;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">A networking protocol</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2375;&#2335;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2325;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2335;&#2379;&#2325;&#2377;&#2354;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">A type of firewall</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2347;&#2364;&#2366;&#2351;&#2352;&#2357;&#2377;&#2354; &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>&#183; Cybersecurity refers to the practice of protecting systems, networks, programs, devices, and data from digital attacks, theft, damage, or unauthorized access. </p><p>&#183; It specifically focuses on defending internet-connected systems from cyber threats, which can include various forms of attacks like malware, phishing, social engineering, and more.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which of these is a common cybersecurity threat?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2311;&#2344;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2366;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2381;&#2351; &#2360;&#2366;&#2311;&#2348;&#2352; &#2360;&#2369;&#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366; &#2326;&#2340;&#2352;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">System updates</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2335;&#2350; &#2309;&#2346;&#2337;&#2375;&#2335;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Antivirus software</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2319;&#2306;&#2335;&#2368;&#2357;&#2366;&#2351;&#2352;&#2360; &#2360;&#2377;&#2347;&#2381;&#2335;&#2357;&#2375;&#2351;&#2352;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Phishing attacks</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2347;&#2364;&#2367;&#2358;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327; &#2361;&#2350;&#2354;&#2375;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Password managers</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2366;&#2360;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2325;</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>&#183; Phishing attacks are a common cybersecurity threat where attackers attempt to trick users into revealing sensitive information like passwords or credit card details by disguising themselves as trustworthy entities. </p><p>&#183; System updates, antivirus software, and password managers are security measures that help protect against threats, not threats themselves.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is two-factor authentication?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2342;&#2379;-&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2325; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2366;&#2339;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Using two different passwords</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2342;&#2379; &#2309;&#2354;&#2327;-&#2309;&#2354;&#2327; &#2346;&#2366;&#2360;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337; &#2325;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2366;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Using two security questions</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2342;&#2379; &#2360;&#2369;&#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2366;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Using two different devices to log in</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2354;&#2377;&#2327; &#2311;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2342;&#2379; &#2309;&#2354;&#2327;-&#2309;&#2354;&#2327; &#2337;&#2367;&#2357;&#2366;&#2311;&#2360; &#2325;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2366;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Using something you know and something you have</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2320;&#2360;&#2368; &#2330;&#2368;&#2332;&#2364; &#2325;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2366; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2375; &#2310;&#2346; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2324;&#2352; &#2332;&#2379; &#2310;&#2346;&#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2366;&#2360; &#2361;&#2376;</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>&#183; Two-factor authentication (2FA) is a security method that requires users to provide two different authentication factors to verify their identity. </p><p>&#183; These factors typically include something you know (like a password) and something you have (like a phone to receive a verification code), making unauthorized access significantly more difficult even if a password is compromised.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is encryption?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2319;&#2344;&#2381;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2346;&#2381;&#2358;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Deleting data</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2337;&#2375;&#2335;&#2366; &#2361;&#2335;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Copying data</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2337;&#2375;&#2335;&#2366; &#2325;&#2377;&#2346;&#2368; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2366;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Converting data into a coded format</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2337;&#2375;&#2335;&#2366; &#2325;&#2379; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337;&#2367;&#2340; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2366;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Downloading data</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2337;&#2375;&#2335;&#2366; &#2337;&#2366;&#2313;&#2344;&#2354;&#2379;&#2337; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2366;</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>&#183; Encryption is the process of converting data into a coded format that is unreadable without the proper decryption key. </p><p>&#183; This process helps protect sensitive information from unauthorized access by transforming readable data (plaintext) into an encoded version (ciphertext) that can only be decoded with the appropriate key.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is a VPN?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2357;&#2368;&#2346;&#2368;&#2319;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Virtual Private Network</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2310;&#2349;&#2366;&#2360;&#2368; &#2344;&#2367;&#2332;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2332;&#2366;&#2354;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Virtual Public Network</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2330;&#2369;&#2309;&#2354; &#2346;&#2348;&#2381;&#2354;&#2367;&#2325; &#2344;&#2375;&#2335;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2325;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Virtual Protected Network</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2330;&#2369;&#2309;&#2354; &#2360;&#2306;&#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2340; &#2344;&#2375;&#2335;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2325;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Virtual Personal Network</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2330;&#2369;&#2309;&#2354; &#2346;&#2352;&#2381;&#2360;&#2344;&#2354; &#2344;&#2375;&#2335;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2325;</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>&#183; VPN stands for Virtual Private Network. It creates a secure, encrypted connection over a less secure network (like the public internet) between your device and another network. </p><p>&#183; VPNs are used to protect privacy, secure data transmission, and access geo-restricted content by masking the user's original IP address.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is a strong password?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2350;&#2332;&#2348;&#2370;&#2340; &#2346;&#2366;&#2360;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Your birth date</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2310;&#2346;&#2325;&#2368; &#2332;&#2344;&#2381;&#2350; &#2340;&#2367;&#2341;&#2367;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Your name</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2310;&#2346;&#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2366;&#2350;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">A mix of letters, numbers, and special characters</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2309;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306;, &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2324;&#2352; &#2357;&#2367;&#2358;&#2375;&#2359; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2339;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">The word \"password\"</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342; \"&#2346;&#2366;&#2360;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337;\"</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>&#183; A strong password contains a mix of uppercase and lowercase letters, numbers, and special characters, making it difficult to guess or crack through brute force methods. </p><p>&#183; Personal information like birth dates or names, as well as common words like \"password,\" are easily guessable and provide minimal security.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is malware?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2350;&#2376;&#2354;&#2357;&#2375;&#2351;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Hardware device</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2361;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337;&#2357;&#2375;&#2351;&#2352; &#2337;&#2367;&#2357;&#2366;&#2311;&#2360;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Malicious software</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2375;&#2354;&#2367;&#2358;&#2367;&#2351;&#2360; &#2360;&#2377;&#2347;&#2381;&#2335;&#2357;&#2375;&#2352;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Network protocol</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2375;&#2335;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2325; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2335;&#2379;&#2325;&#2377;&#2354;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Security tool</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2369;&#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339;</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>&#183; Malware (short for \"malicious software\") refers to any software intentionally designed to cause damage to a computer, server, client, or computer network.</p><p>&#183; Types of malware include viruses, worms, trojans, ransomware, spyware, adware, and more, each with different methods of infection and harmful effects.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is a firewall?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2347;&#2364;&#2366;&#2351;&#2352;&#2357;&#2377;&#2354; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">A physical wall</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2319;&#2325; &#2349;&#2380;&#2340;&#2367;&#2325; &#2342;&#2368;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">A network security system</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2375;&#2335;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2325; &#2360;&#2369;&#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2339;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">An antivirus program</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2319;&#2325; &#2319;&#2306;&#2335;&#2368;&#2357;&#2366;&#2351;&#2352;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">A password manager</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2319;&#2325; &#2346;&#2366;&#2360;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337; &#2350;&#2376;&#2344;&#2375;&#2332;&#2352;</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>&#183; A firewall is a network security system that monitors and controls incoming and outgoing network traffic based on predetermined security rules. </p><p>&#183; It acts as a barrier between a trusted internal network and untrusted external networks (like the internet), helping to block malicious traffic while allowing legitimate communications to pass through.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is social engineering?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2360;&#2379;&#2358;&#2354; &#2311;&#2306;&#2332;&#2368;&#2344;&#2367;&#2351;&#2352;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Social media marketing</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2366;&#2350;&#2366;&#2332;&#2367;&#2325; &#2350;&#2366;&#2343;&#2381;&#2351;&#2350; &#2348;&#2366;&#2332;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Manipulating people to give up confidential information</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2327;&#2379;&#2346;&#2344;&#2368;&#2351; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2342;&#2375;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2348;&#2361;&#2325;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Building social networks</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2366;&#2350;&#2366;&#2332;&#2367;&#2325; &#2344;&#2375;&#2335;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2325; &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2350;&#2366;&#2339;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Creating social media accounts</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2379;&#2358;&#2354; &#2350;&#2368;&#2337;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2309;&#2325;&#2366;&#2313;&#2306;&#2335; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366;</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>&#183; Social engineering is a manipulation technique that exploits human psychology to trick people into revealing confidential information or performing actions that compromise security. </p><p>&#183; Instead of breaking through technical security systems, attackers use deception to manipulate people into breaking normal security procedures, often through methods like pretexting, baiting, or phishing.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is a data breach?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2337;&#2375;&#2335;&#2366; &#2313;&#2354;&#2381;&#2354;&#2306;&#2328;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Data backup</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2337;&#2375;&#2335;&#2366; &#2348;&#2376;&#2325;&#2309;&#2346;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Data encryption</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2337;&#2375;&#2335;&#2366; &#2319;&#2344;&#2381;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2346;&#2381;&#2358;&#2344;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Unauthorized access to data</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2337;&#2375;&#2335;&#2366; &#2340;&#2325; &#2309;&#2344;&#2343;&#2367;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2346;&#2361;&#2369;&#2306;&#2330;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Data transfer</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2337;&#2375;&#2335;&#2366; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352;&#2339;</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>&#183; A data breach is a security incident in which information is accessed, stolen, or exposed without authorization. </p><p>&#183; This can involve personal data, financial information, intellectual property, or other sensitive information. </p><p>&#183; Data breaches can occur through various methods, including hacking, malware, social engineering, or insider threats.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is phishing?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2347;&#2364;&#2367;&#2358;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">A fishing activity</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2331;&#2354;&#2368; &#2346;&#2325;&#2337;&#2364;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367;&#2357;&#2367;&#2343;&#2367;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">A legitimate email</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2376;&#2343; &#2312;&#2350;&#2375;&#2354;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Fraudulent attempt to obtain sensitive information</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2306;&#2357;&#2375;&#2342;&#2344;&#2358;&#2368;&#2354; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2343;&#2379;&#2326;&#2366;&#2343;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368;&#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2351;&#2366;&#2360;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">A type of password</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2366;&#2360;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337; &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>&#183; Phishing is a cybercrime where attackers disguise themselves as trustworthy entities to trick victims into revealing sensitive information such as usernames, passwords, credit card details, or other personal data. </p><p>&#183; This is typically done through deceptive emails, messages, or websites that appear legitimate but are designed to steal information.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is ransomware?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2352;&#2376;&#2306;&#2360;&#2350;&#2357;&#2375;&#2351;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Software that demands payment for encrypted data</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2377;&#2347;&#2381;&#2335;&#2357;&#2375;&#2351;&#2352; &#2332;&#2379; &#2319;&#2344;&#2381;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2346;&#2381;&#2335;&#2375;&#2337; &#2337;&#2375;&#2335;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2349;&#2369;&#2327;&#2340;&#2366;&#2344; &#2350;&#2366;&#2306;&#2327;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Antivirus software</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2319;&#2306;&#2335;&#2368;&#2357;&#2366;&#2351;&#2352;&#2360; &#2360;&#2377;&#2347;&#2381;&#2335;&#2357;&#2375;&#2351;&#2352;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Networking software</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2375;&#2335;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2325;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327; &#2360;&#2377;&#2347;&#2381;&#2335;&#2357;&#2375;&#2351;&#2352;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Operating system</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2321;&#2346;&#2352;&#2375;&#2335;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327; &#2360;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2335;&#2350;</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>&#183; Ransomware is a type of malicious software that encrypts a victim's files, making them inaccessible, and demands a ransom payment to restore access. </p><p>&#183; Attackers threaten to publish the victim's data or permanently block access to it unless the ransom is paid. </p><p>&#183; It's a growing threat that targets both individuals and organizations.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Consider the following statements about cybersecurity:</p><p>I. It protects against unauthorized access</p><p>II. It only applies to computers</p><p>III. It includes data protection</p><p>IV. It requires regular updates</p><p>Choose the correct answer:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2360;&#2366;&#2311;&#2348;&#2352; &#2360;&#2369;&#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2352;&#2375; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2346;&#2352; &#2357;&#2367;&#2330;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;:</p><p>I. &#2351;&#2361; &#2309;&#2344;&#2343;&#2367;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2346;&#2361;&#2369;&#2305;&#2330; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2369;&#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;</p><p>II. &#2351;&#2361; &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2325;&#2306;&#2346;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2335;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2370; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;</p><p>III. &#2311;&#2360;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2337;&#2375;&#2335;&#2366; &#2360;&#2369;&#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366; &#2358;&#2366;&#2350;&#2367;&#2354; &#2361;&#2376;</p><p>IV. &#2311;&#2360;&#2375; &#2344;&#2367;&#2351;&#2350;&#2367;&#2340; &#2309;&#2346;&#2337;&#2375;&#2335; &#2325;&#2368; &#2310;&#2357;&#2358;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;</p><p>&#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2330;&#2369;&#2344;&#2375;&#2306;:</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">I and III only</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; I &#2324;&#2352; III</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">II and IV only</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; II &#2324;&#2352; IV</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">I, III and IV only</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; I, III &#2324;&#2352; IV</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">All of the above</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2314;&#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2349;&#2368;</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>&#183; Cybersecurity protects against unauthorized access (I is correct), includes data protection measures (III is correct), and requires regular updates to address new vulnerabilities and threats (IV is correct). </p><p>&#183; However, it doesn't only apply to computers (II is incorrect) but extends to all digital devices, networks, and systems, including smartphones, IoT devices, servers, cloud services, and more.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Match List I with List II:</p><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;\"><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">List I (Security Measure)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">List II (Purpose)</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">A. Firewall</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">i. Data encoding</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">B. Encryption</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">ii. Network protection</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">C. Antivirus</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">iii. Malware detection</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">D. Password Manager</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">iv. Credential security</td></tr></table><p>Choose the correct match:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2360;&#2370;&#2330;&#2368; I &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2370;&#2330;&#2368; II &#2360;&#2375; &#2350;&#2367;&#2354;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;:</p><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;\"><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">&#2360;&#2370;&#2330;&#2368; I (&#2360;&#2369;&#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2366;&#2351;)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">&#2360;&#2370;&#2330;&#2368; II (&#2313;&#2342;&#2381;&#2342;&#2375;&#2358;&#2381;&#2351;)</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">A. &#2347;&#2364;&#2366;&#2351;&#2352;&#2357;&#2377;&#2354;</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">i. &#2337;&#2375;&#2335;&#2366; &#2319;&#2344;&#2381;&#2325;&#2379;&#2337;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327;</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">B. &#2319;&#2344;&#2381;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2346;&#2381;&#2358;&#2344;</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">ii. &#2344;&#2375;&#2335;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2325; &#2360;&#2369;&#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366;</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">C. &#2319;&#2306;&#2335;&#2368;&#2357;&#2366;&#2351;&#2352;&#2360;</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">iii. &#2350;&#2376;&#2354;&#2357;&#2375;&#2351;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2340;&#2366; &#2354;&#2327;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366;</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">D. &#2346;&#2366;&#2360;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337; &#2350;&#2376;&#2344;&#2375;&#2332;&#2352;</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">iv. &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2337;&#2375;&#2306;&#2358;&#2367;&#2351;&#2354; &#2360;&#2369;&#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366;</td></tr></table><p>&#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2350;&#2367;&#2354;&#2366;&#2344; &#2330;&#2369;&#2344;&#2375;&#2306;:</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">A-ii, B-i, C-iii, D-iv</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">A-ii, B-i, C-iii, D-iv</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">A-i, B-ii, C-iii, D-iv</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">A-i, B-ii, C-iii, D-iv</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">A-ii, B-iii, C-i, D-iv</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">A-ii, B-iii, C-i, D-iv</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">A-iv, B-i, C-ii, D-iii</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">A-iv, B-i, C-ii, D-iii</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>&#183; Firewalls provide network protection by monitoring and filtering network traffic. </p><p>&#183; Encryption involves data encoding to protect information from unauthorized access. </p><p>&#183; Antivirus software focuses on malware detection to identify and remove malicious software. </p><p>&#183; Password managers enhance credential security by securely storing and managing passwords.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which of the following statements about passwords is correct?</p><p>I. Should be changed regularly</p><p>II. Can be shared with trusted friends</p><p>III. Should be complex</p><p>IV. Should be same for all accounts</p><p>Choose the correct answer:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2346;&#2366;&#2360;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2352;&#2375; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</p><p>I. &#2344;&#2367;&#2351;&#2350;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;</p><p>II. &#2357;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2357;&#2360;&#2344;&#2368;&#2351; &#2350;&#2367;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2360;&#2366;&#2333;&#2366; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;</p><p>III. &#2332;&#2335;&#2367;&#2354; &#2361;&#2379;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;</p><p>IV. &#2360;&#2349;&#2368; &#2326;&#2366;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2379;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;</p><p>&#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2330;&#2369;&#2344;&#2375;&#2306;:</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">I and III only</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; I &#2324;&#2352; III</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">II and III only</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; II &#2324;&#2352; III</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">I and IV only</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; I &#2324;&#2352; IV</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">All of the above</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2314;&#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2349;&#2368;</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>&#183; Passwords should be changed regularly (I is correct) to minimize the risk of compromise over time. </p><p>&#183; They should also be complex (III is correct), containing a mix of characters to resist cracking attempts. </p><p>&#183; However, passwords should never be shared with anyone, even trusted friends (II is incorrect), and using the same password across multiple accounts (IV is incorrect) creates a single point of failure if one account is compromised.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Consider these statements about data backups:</p><p>I. Should be regular</p><p>II. Should be stored in multiple locations</p><p>III. Are unnecessary with cloud storage</p><p>Choose the correct answer:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2337;&#2375;&#2335;&#2366; &#2348;&#2376;&#2325;&#2309;&#2346; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2352;&#2375; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2311;&#2344; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2346;&#2352; &#2357;&#2367;&#2330;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;:</p><p>I. &#2344;&#2367;&#2351;&#2350;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;</p><p>II. &#2325;&#2312; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2346;&#2352; &#2360;&#2306;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2361;&#2368;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;</p><p>III. &#2325;&#2381;&#2354;&#2366;&#2313;&#2337; &#2360;&#2381;&#2335;&#2379;&#2352;&#2375;&#2332; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2309;&#2344;&#2366;&#2357;&#2358;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;</p><p>&#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2330;&#2369;&#2344;&#2375;&#2306;:</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">I only</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; I</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">I and II only</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; I &#2324;&#2352; II</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">II and III only</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; II &#2324;&#2352; III</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">All of the above</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2314;&#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2349;&#2368;</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>&#183; Data backups should be performed regularly (I is correct) to minimize data loss in case of system failures or attacks. </p><p>&#183; They should also be stored in multiple locations (II is correct) following the 3-2-1 backup rule (3 copies, 2 different media types, 1 off-site). </p><p>&#183; Statement III is incorrect because even with cloud storage, backups are still necessary as cloud services themselves can experience outages, data corruption, or security breaches.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Match these cyber threats with their characteristics:</p><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;\"><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">A. Phishing</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">i. Fake emails</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">B. Ransomware</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">ii. Encrypts files for ransom</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">C. Malware</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">iii. Malicious software</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">D. Social Engineering</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">iv. Human manipulation</td></tr></table><p>Select the correct code:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2311;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366;&#2311;&#2348;&#2352; &#2326;&#2340;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2313;&#2344;&#2325;&#2368; &#2357;&#2367;&#2358;&#2375;&#2359;&#2340;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2350;&#2367;&#2354;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;:</p><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;\"><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">A. &#2347;&#2364;&#2367;&#2358;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327;</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">i. &#2347;&#2364;&#2352;&#2381;&#2332;&#2368; &#2312;&#2350;&#2375;&#2354;</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">B. &#2352;&#2376;&#2344;&#2360;&#2350;&#2357;&#2375;&#2351;&#2352;</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">ii. &#2347;&#2367;&#2352;&#2380;&#2340;&#2368; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2347;&#2364;&#2366;&#2311;&#2354;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2319;&#2344;&#2381;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2346;&#2381;&#2335; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">C. &#2350;&#2376;&#2354;&#2357;&#2375;&#2351;&#2352;</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">iii. &#2342;&#2369;&#2352;&#2381;&#2349;&#2366;&#2357;&#2344;&#2366;&#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339; &#2360;&#2377;&#2347;&#2364;&#2381;&#2335;&#2357;&#2375;&#2351;&#2352;</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">D. &#2360;&#2379;&#2358;&#2354; &#2311;&#2306;&#2332;&#2368;&#2344;&#2367;&#2351;&#2352;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327;</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">iv. &#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2357;&#2368;&#2351; &#2361;&#2375;&#2352;&#2347;&#2375;&#2352;</td></tr></table><p>&#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337; &#2330;&#2369;&#2344;&#2375;&#2306;:</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">A-ii, B-i, C-iii, D-iv</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">A-ii, B-i, C-iii, D-iv</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">A-i, B-ii, C-iii, D-iv</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">A-i, B-ii, C-iii, D-iv</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">A-ii, B-iv, C-i, D-iii</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">A-ii, B-iv, C-i, D-iii</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">A-iii, B-iv, C-i, D-ii</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">A-iii, B-iv, C-i, D-ii</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>&#183; Phishing typically uses fake emails to trick users into revealing sensitive information. </p><p>&#183; Ransomware encrypts files for ransom demanding payment to restore access. </p><p>&#183; Malware is the general term for malicious software designed to harm systems. </p><p>&#183; Social Engineering involves human manipulation to bypass security measures.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Identify the correct statements about encryption:</p><p>I. Makes data unreadable</p><p>II. Is unnecessary for personal data</p><p>III. Uses complex algorithms</p><p>IV. Can be easily broken</p><p>Choose the correct answer:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2319;&#2344;&#2381;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2346;&#2381;&#2358;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2352;&#2375; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2346;&#2361;&#2330;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;:</p><p>I. &#2337;&#2375;&#2335;&#2366; &#2325;&#2379; &#2309;&#2346;&#2336;&#2344;&#2368;&#2351; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;</p><p>II. &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367;&#2327;&#2340; &#2337;&#2375;&#2335;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2309;&#2344;&#2366;&#2357;&#2358;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;</p><p>III. &#2332;&#2335;&#2367;&#2354; &#2319;&#2354;&#2381;&#2327;&#2379;&#2352;&#2367;&#2342;&#2350; &#2325;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;</p><p>IV. &#2310;&#2360;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368; &#2360;&#2375; &#2340;&#2379;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;</p><p>&#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2330;&#2369;&#2344;&#2375;&#2306;:</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">I and III only</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; I &#2324;&#2352; III</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">II and IV only</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; II &#2324;&#2352; IV</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">I, II and IV only</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; I, II &#2319;&#2357;&#2306; IV</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">All of the above</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2314;&#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2349;&#2368;</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>&#183; Encryption makes data unreadable without the proper decryption key (I is correct) and uses complex mathematical algorithms to transform the data (III is correct).</p><p>&#183; Statement II is incorrect because personal data often contains sensitive information that should be protected through encryption. </p><p>&#183; Statement IV is incorrect because properly implemented modern encryption cannot be easily broken and would require enormous computational resources or quantum computing capabilities to crack.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Consider these cybersecurity best practices:</p><p>I. Regular software updates</p><p>II. Strong passwords</p><p>III. Public Wi-Fi usage</p><p>IV. Two-factor authentication</p><p>Select the correct answer:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2311;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366;&#2311;&#2348;&#2352; &#2360;&#2369;&#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366; &#2360;&#2352;&#2381;&#2357;&#2379;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2350; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2341;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2346;&#2352; &#2357;&#2367;&#2330;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;:</p><p>I. &#2344;&#2367;&#2351;&#2350;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2377;&#2347;&#2364;&#2381;&#2335;&#2357;&#2375;&#2351;&#2352; &#2309;&#2346;&#2337;&#2375;&#2335;</p><p>II. &#2350;&#2332;&#2364;&#2348;&#2370;&#2340; &#2346;&#2366;&#2360;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337;</p><p>III. &#2360;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2357;&#2332;&#2344;&#2367;&#2325; &#2357;&#2366;&#2312;-&#2347;&#2364;&#2366;&#2312; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327;</p><p>IV. &#2342;&#2379;-&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2325; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2366;&#2339;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339;</p><p>&#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2330;&#2369;&#2344;&#2375;&#2306;:</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">I and II only</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; I &#2324;&#2352; II</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">III and IV only</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; III &#2324;&#2352; IV</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">I, II and IV only</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; I, II &#2319;&#2357;&#2306; IV</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">All of the above</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2314;&#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2349;&#2368;</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>&#183; Regular software updates help patch security vulnerabilities. </p><p>&#183; Strong passwords make unauthorized access more difficult. </p><p>&#183; Two-factor authentication adds an extra layer of security beyond passwords.</p><p>&#183; However, using public Wi-Fi networks without additional protection like a VPN is generally considered a security risk, not a best practice, as these networks can be easily compromised or monitored.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select which of the given statement(s) is/are True or False for Phishing Attacks in cyber security.</p><p>(i) Phishing attacks always involve sending emails to trick users into revealing sensitive information.</p><p>(ii) Phishing attacks can also occur through fake websites or malicious links designed to steal personal data.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2360;&#2366;&#2311;&#2348;&#2352; &#2360;&#2369;&#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2347;&#2364;&#2367;&#2358;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327; &#2361;&#2350;&#2354;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366;/&#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2354;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2311;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p>(i) &#2347;&#2364;&#2367;&#2358;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327; &#2361;&#2350;&#2354;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2361;&#2350;&#2375;&#2358;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2306;&#2357;&#2375;&#2342;&#2344;&#2358;&#2368;&#2354; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2326;&#2369;&#2354;&#2366;&#2360;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2343;&#2379;&#2326;&#2366; &#2342;&#2375;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2312;&#2350;&#2375;&#2354; &#2349;&#2375;&#2332;&#2344;&#2366; &#2358;&#2366;&#2350;&#2367;&#2354; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p><p>(ii) &#2347;&#2364;&#2367;&#2358;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327; &#2361;&#2350;&#2354;&#2375; &#2344;&#2325;&#2354;&#2368; &#2357;&#2375;&#2348;&#2360;&#2366;&#2311;&#2335;&#2379;&#2306; &#2351;&#2366; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367;&#2327;&#2340; &#2337;&#2375;&#2335;&#2366; &#2330;&#2379;&#2352;&#2368; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2337;&#2367;&#2332;&#2364;&#2366;&#2311;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2342;&#2369;&#2352;&#2381;&#2349;&#2366;&#2357;&#2344;&#2366;&#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339; &#2354;&#2367;&#2306;&#2325; &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2366;&#2343;&#2381;&#2351;&#2350; &#2360;&#2375; &#2349;&#2368; &#2361;&#2379; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">(i) True, (ii) True</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(i) &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;, (ii) &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">(i) False, (ii) True</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(i) &#2309;&#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;, (ii) &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">(i) True, (ii) False</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(i) &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;, (ii) &#2309;&#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">(i) False, (ii) False</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(i) &#2309;&#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;, (ii) &#2309;&#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>Statement (i) is false because phishing attacks are not limited to emails; they can also occur through text messages (smishing), phone calls (vishing), or social media.</p><p>Statement (ii) is true as phishing attacks often involve fake websites or malicious links that mimic legitimate sites to steal personal information like passwords or credit card details.</p>","marks":2,"section":null}]}